# GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964 - msgpack (vendored inside pip's internal tooling)
# Confirmed via pip's own vendor.txt (github.com/pypa/pip) that the current
# pip release still vendors msgpack==1.1.2 internally - not fixable via
# requirements.txt or --upgrade, since it's bundled in pip's own source,
# not a normal installed package. No runtime code path in this app; only
# exercised internally by pip during the Docker build. Accepted as
# residual risk pending an upstream pip release. Recheck periodically.
GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964

